---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITIO } from "../config";
---

<Base titulo="Legal notice, privacy and cookies" descripcion={`Who runs ${SITIO.dominio}, how we handle data, cookies and advertising, and where the prices come from.`} lang="en" anuncioFinal={false}>
  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <h1>Legal notice, privacy and cookies</h1>
      <p class="caption">Last updated: 27 October 2026</p>
      <h2>Who runs this website</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Owner:</strong> {SITIO.titular}</li>
        <li><strong>Tax ID (NIF):</strong> {SITIO.nif}</li>
        <li><strong>Address:</strong> {SITIO.domicilio}</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${SITIO.correo}`}>{SITIO.correo}</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>{SITIO.nombre} is a free information service. We do not sell electricity and are not linked to any supplier, grid operator or public body. Prices are wholesale figures for information only; your bill depends on your contract.</p>
      <h2>Sources and licences</h2>
      <p>Day-ahead prices: ENTSO-E Transparency Platform, and Bundesnetzagentur | SMARD.de via Energy-Charts (CC BY 4.0), published without changes except the hourly average. Exchange rates: European Central Bank reference rates.</p>
      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>You can use the site without giving us any personal data: there are no accounts or forms. Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, Inc., processes technical data (such as IP addresses) to serve the site and protect it from attacks; Cloudflare is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
      <p>The site is financed by Google AdSense. Google Ireland Limited, as an independent controller, may process browsing data (cookies, device identifiers, IP address) to show and measure ads and prevent fraud and, only with your consent, to personalise them. You can give, refuse or withdraw consent at any time in the consent tool shown on the site. More in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p>
      <p>You can access, rectify and erase your data and object to its processing by writing to the email above, and complain to the Spanish Data Protection Agency (<a href="https://www.aepd.es/" rel="noopener">AEPD</a>) or your local authority.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We do not set any cookies ourselves. Advertising cookies from Google and its partners are only used after you accept them in the consent message (a certified IAB TCF consent management platform). If you refuse, you may see limited, non-personalised ads.</p>
      <h2>Applicable law</h2>
      <p>This website is governed by Spanish law. If you are a consumer, the courts of your place of residence have jurisdiction.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
